<h1>Help Centre</h1>
<p>Find answers to common questions about using BlogApp.</p>

<h2>Getting started</h2>
<p>Create a free account, explore posts on the Discover page, and follow writers you enjoy.</p>

<h2>Writing & publishing</h2>
<p>Sign in and click <strong>New Post</strong> to draft and publish articles. You can save drafts and update posts anytime.</p>

<h2>Account & billing</h2>
<p>Manage your profile from the Profile page. Premium subscriptions can be upgraded from the Upgrade link in the header.</p>

<h2>Need more help?</h2>
<p>Reach out to our support team and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
